  "technique_limits": {
    "chord_span": 12,
    "melodic_leap": 17,
    "rapid_leap": 9
  },
  "technical_note": "The LH answers the opening four RH notes an octave lower with exactly twice their durations. Hold the tied A through the bar line. The same procedure returns in bars 5\u20137. The final answer in bars 9\u201310 omits A; allow that silence to be heard before the closing major ninth.",
